        "text": "Munster U20H Traffic Advisory\n\nSupporters traveling to Sixmilebridge this evening for the Fulfil Munster GAA U20 Hurling game - Clare v Limerick are advised to access the venue via the old roads in light of the ongoing fuel protests on the motorways.\n\nLimerick supporters should access Sixmilebridge via the Moylish & Cratloe back roads.\n\nClare supporters should access Sixmilebridge via the Quin & Newmarket on Fergus back roads.\n\nPatrons are advised to travel early to avoid expected delays.\n\nhttps://t.co/uH8k3Meqof",
